comfyui-styles-all
https://github.com/aegis72/comfyui-styles-all (commit acfea62)
A clone of the styles of azazeal04, removed by the author on 2024-01-21.

Used in: common-extension/shared_backend/default_snippets.json, the default
snippets of the Library tab. The SAI folder is sdxl_styles_sai.json, the TWRI
folder sdxl_styles_twri.json, and the General folder the styles of data/ (one
subfolder per data folder; the word lists nouns, adjective, verbing and
preposition and the artist styles are left out). "None" entries are omitted,
whitespace is normalized, and a "{prompt}" placeholder that ended a style of
data/ is moved to its start, so the style is appended to the prompt.
